      "content": "where $\\left(H_{0}^{(1)}\\right)_{nn}$ is the diagonal matrix element of the operator $H_{0}^{(1)}$ relative to the $x_{i}$, thus by (28b) a homogeneous linear function of $\\zeta_{i}$. This must however, by (38), be constant, since $\\chi_{n}^{(0)}(\\zeta,\\theta)$ cannot vanish identically without the same being true for $\\psi_{n}^{(0)}$.",
