      "topLeftY": 847,
      "bottomRightX": 643,
      "bottomRightY": 890,
      "content": "$$\\left\\{H_{\\zeta\\zeta}^{(0)}\\left(\\xi_{i}\\frac{\\partial^{2}}{\\partial\\zeta_{i}\\partial\\zeta_{j}}\\right) + \\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{ij}\\zeta_{i}\\zeta_{j}\\frac{\\partial^{2}V_{n}}{\\partial\\xi_{i}\\partial\\xi_{j}} - W_{n}^{(2)}\\right\\}\\chi_{n}^{(0)} = 0. \\tag{46}$$",
